      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, very clean. I like the tone.\n\nActually, looking at the internal dashboard, the richness score for that draft came back a bit low—it's around 12. I know I said not to focus on it, but for our top-tier clients, we really need the descriptions to feel \"lush\" and incredibly detailed. \n\nCould you try a second version? Try to expand on the sensory details—the feeling of the marble, the light, the view—and really lean into the descriptive language. I still want it to stay professional and elegant, but let's make it feel much more \"rich\" and evocative than the first one. We want the reader to feel immersed.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "This majestic villa, situated atop a privileged promontory, embodies the essence of la dolce vita. As you step inside, the soft glow of natural light pours in through floor-to-ceiling glass walls and expansive windows, bathing the interior in a warm, golden radiance that seems to emanate from the very heart of the Mediterranean. The air is alive with the subtle scent of freshly polished marble, its creamy white surfaces gleaming with a soft, luminous sheen that seems to shift and shimmer in the light. Every step reveals a new delight: the gentle curve of a console table, the delicate etching of a marble column, the soft, velvety texture of a plush sofa. The infinity pool, a shimmering ribbon of turquoise that stretches out to the horizon, seems to dissolve the boundaries between indoors and outdoors, creating a seamless, dreamlike fusion of space and sea. As the sun sets, the sky is set aflame, casting a warm, golden glow over the villa and its surroundings, and the sound of the waves gently lapping at the shore creates a soothing melody that seems to lull the world into a peaceful slumber. With its unparalleled vistas, refined design, and sumptuous amenities, this extraordinary",
